Subject: [PATCH 297/333] [ae-patch] Let the Social card open LinkedIn's share
 box and a YouTube channel's Posts tab

The host opens only allowlisted links, so the Social card's Open buttons fell back to "paste it yourself". aeExternalUrls.ts admits two more exact shapes: https://www.linkedin.com/feed/?shareActive=true, optionally with a single &text= parameter (percent-encoded, decoding to at most 3,000 characters, apostrophe written as %27), and https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC<22 characters>/posts. Strict regexes, a round-trip check through new URL, no userinfo, port, fragment or other parameter. navigation.openExternal checks both predicates; the tests sit beside the file and the host service.
